    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/mkazm4-w0/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=626220750524646059&sectionId=626220774331515757)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMY7bP0nP8_text","label":"ggMY7bP0nP8_text","default":"frequently asked questions"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3wzJFOJNw_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg3wzJFOJNw_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2005/9307/files/shutterstock_2168252699_1.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbUgfuh6XR_childItem_0","label":"ggbUgfuh6XR_childItem_0","default":"<p>What exactly is this product?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbUgfuh6XR_childItem_1","label":"ggbUgfuh6XR_childItem_1","default":"<p>How is this different from energy drinks or nootropics?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbUgfuh6XR_childItem_2","label":"ggbUgfuh6XR_childItem_2","default":"<p>When will I start noticing effects?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbUgfuh6XR_childItem_3","label":"ggbUgfuh6XR_childItem_3","default":"<p>How do I take it?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbUgfuh6XR_childItem_4","label":"ggbUgfuh6XR_childItem_4","default":"<p>Can I take this with coffee?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbUgfuh6XR_childItem_5","label":"ggbUgfuh6XR_childItem_5","default":"<p>What if I don’t feel a dramatic change?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbUgfuh6XR_childItem_6","label":"ggbUgfuh6XR_childItem_6","default":"<p>Is there a guarantee?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyz8AoIoY7_text","label":"ggyz8AoIoY7_text","default":"<p>This is a <strong>daily longevity bottle</strong> designed to support long-term energy, mental endurance, and recovery — without relying on stimulants.<br>It works by supporting the body’s <strong>foundational systems</strong> (cellular energy, stress response, and recovery), not by forcing short-term “boosts.”</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggptOK70fRh_text","label":"ggptOK70fRh_text","default":"<p>Most energy products <strong>push your nervous system</strong> for immediate effect.<br>This product focuses on <strong>stability and resilience</strong> — helping you maintain clarity and stamina throughout the day, without crashes, jitters, or overstimulation.</p><p>Think <strong>controlled performance</strong>, not artificial acceleration</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBU5-4rl4s_text","label":"ggBU5-4rl4s_text","default":"<p>Many users report subtle improvements in <strong>mental clarity and energy stability within the first 7–14 days</strong>.<br>Deeper benefits — such as better focus endurance, improved sleep quality, and faster recovery — typically become more noticeable with <strong>consistent daily use over 30+ days</strong>.</p><p>Longevity works gradually, not instantly.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCdX3TJMIi_text","label":"ggCdX3TJMIi_text","default":"<p>Simply take <strong>one serving per day</strong>, ideally at the same time each day.<br>No cycling, no stacking, no complex timing required.</p><p>Consistency matters more than dosage.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGzG5gZnhi_text","label":"ggGzG5gZnhi_text","default":"<p>Yes. This product does not conflict with caffeine.<br>However, many users find they <strong>naturally rely less on coffee</strong> over time as their baseline energy becomes more stable.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrWmXArqsd_text","label":"ggrWmXArqsd_text","default":"<p>That’s normal — and expected.<br>This product is designed to improve <strong>how you feel across the entire day</strong>, not deliver a noticeable “kick.”</p><p>If you feel <strong>less drained at the end of the day</strong>, more consistent focus, and better recovery — it’s working.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUXYFiXzHH_text","label":"ggUXYFiXzHH_text","default":"<p>Yes. If you don’t feel it fits your routine or expectations, you’re covered by our <strong>30-day satisfaction guarantee</strong>.</p>"}],
